\title{GeneGalleon tree visualization API}
\description{
Internal plotting, annotation, alignment, motif, and tree-layout helpers used by
GeneGalleon's R workflow entry points. These functions are exported so the
entry-point scripts can use a stable installed-package boundary.
}
\details{
The API is intended for GeneGalleon workflow code. Inputs are generally the
plot state and parsed workflow arguments described by the corresponding
entry-point script.
}
\keyword{internal}
